# Enterprise Financial Data Platform

A production-oriented Java Full Stack project designed to simulate the architecture, engineering practices, and development lifecycle used in modern enterprise financial applications.

The project is being built incrementally as a real-world learning and portfolio project, with a focus on backend engineering, microservices, cloud, event-driven systems, databases, DevOps, observability, security, and frontend development.

## Project Goal

The goal of this project is to build a complete enterprise financial platform from scratch and understand how different technologies work together in a production-style environment.

The platform will eventually support:

- Customer Management
- Account Management
- Transaction Processing
- Authentication and Authorization
- Event-Driven Processing
- Batch Processing
- Notifications
- Audit Tracking
- Reporting and Analytics
- Operational Dashboards
- Monitoring and Production Support

