## High-Level Architecture

The platform will gradually evolve into a microservices-based architecture.

Expected flow:

User
→ Angular Frontend
→ API Gateway
→ Spring Boot Microservices
→ Oracle / Redis / Kafka
→ Notification, Audit and Reporting Services
→ Snowflake Analytics

The application will later be deployed using Docker, Kubernetes, AWS, CI/CD pipelines, and Infrastructure as Code.

